# Keep the build context (sent to the Docker daemon before any COPY/exclude
# logic in the Dockerfile even runs) small and reproducible. The Dockerfile
# copies specific paths, not `COPY . .`, but an un-ignored node_modules/
# alone would still slow every local build significantly.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.git
.github
.claude
docs
plan_examples
apps/ios
apps/android
*.md
.DS_Store
